                    "description": "3x10 min Sleep or Play Soundscapes with freshwater insects and plant life by Rie Sinclair, creator of The Wonder Club.\n\nThis free digital card was made by an Independent Creator and published on Yoto Space. Visit Open Mic on Yoto Space to discover more great free titles!  \n\nCreator: Rie Sinclair  \nFrom the Creator: “It's a sub-terrain forest!! A free preview of the full 3 hour field recording by Rie Sinclair, creator of The Wonder Club. These 3x10 min Sleep or Play Soundscapes feature freshwater insects and plant life, sounds typically inaudible to human hearing. The recordings have a white noise-like soothing quality and will automatically fade at 30 min (or any increments thereof), so set your timer, and let this secret water-scape lull you to sleep!”  \n\nFor ages: all ages  \nFeatured on Discover until 1st October \nStays in your library and available on Yoto Space at any time",
